{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ttGF2lpCK21792748860.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關發現一名本地男子，攜帶兩隻懷疑受管制瀕危物種活龜入境。</p><p></p><p>海關人員昨日在落馬洲支線管制站入境大堂，截查一名50歲抵港本地男旅客，經檢查後，在其膠袋內檢獲兩隻活龜，估計市值約3,000元。漁護署員到場查驗後，初步鑑定兩隻活龜屬受管制瀕危物種活龜，案件轉交漁護署跟進調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:45.534485+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:39.449709+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:17.343229+00:00","content_hash":"8a13183e39474a374cf1b90c861f966b2292da5c72af049451df9693aa3d685b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:45.534485+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}